questions.question:
Calculate the perimeter of the figure below.

\begin{center}
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.42]
  \draw (0,0)--(9,0)--(9,5)--(8,5)
        arc[start angle=0, end angle=-180, radius=3.5]--(0,5)--cycle;
  \node[above] at (0.5,5) {1cm};
  \node[above] at (8.5,5) {1cm};
  \node[right] at (9,2.5) {5cm};
  \node[below] at (4.5,0) {9cm};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{center}
